ate a MEMO template for staff salary increase that can be used every year, named as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" and saved in \"Documents/Human Resources Team\", including name, email, salary amount, assignment start and end date. Populate the MEMO information from the salary_increase.txt in \"Documents/Human Resources Team\" for each of the employees. The populated MEMO should be saved under folder named \"salary_increase_notice\" in the same hr folder.\\n     2\\t\\n', path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}, thought='Now I need to understand the task. I need to:\\n\\n1. Navigate to ownCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Create a MEMO template for staff salary increases\\n3. Save it as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" in \"Documents/Human Resources Team\"\\n4. Populate the MEMO from salary_increase.txt for each employee\\n5. Save populated MEMOs in \"salary_increase_notice\" folder\\n\\nFirst, let me check if there\\'s an existing SOP for ownCloud operations:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'ownCloud\\': Authentication, FileNavigation, FileUploadDownload, CreateCareerLadderDocument, AttendanceAnalysis, FindAndDownloadSeedAreaFile, CompleteIRSForm6765, PaymentMatchingAnalysis, CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink, CreateEmployeeManual, FindImmigrationFilingDates\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateCareerLadderDocument'}, thought=\"Let me check if there's a specific SOP for creating documents or templates in ownCloud:\", action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_ris