Employee Name],\\n\\nThis memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] to [End Date].\\n\\nYour current salary of $[Current Salary] has been increased by [Percentage Increase]%, resulting in a new annual salary of $[New Salary].\\n\\n[Additional content...]\\n\\nEmployee Email: [Email]\\nAssignment Period: [Start Date] to [End Date]\\n```\\n'}, thought='Perfect! I can see that all 10 individual salary increase memos have been successfully created and uploaded to the \"salary_increase_notice\" folder. Each employee has their personalized memo with their specific salary increase information.\\n\\nLet me now create a comprehensive SOP for this task since we\\'ve successfully completed it:', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'CreateSalaryIncreaseMEMOTemplate', 'details': '\\n# OwnCloud - Create Salary Increase MEMO Template\\n\\n## Steps:\\n1. Navigate to OwnCloud at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. Access the Human Resources Team folder: /Documents/Human Resources Team/\\n3. Download the salary_increase.txt file using curl:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase.txt\" -o salary_increase.txt`\\n4. Create a MEMO template that includes:\\n   - Employee name\\n   - Email address\\n   - Current salary amount\\n   - Percentage increase\\n   - New salary amount\\n   - Assignment start and end dates\\n5. Generate personalized memos for each employee using the template\\n6. Create the salary_increase_notice folder in ownCloud:\\n   `curl -u \"theagentcompany:theagentcompany\" -X MKCOL \"http://the-agent-company.com:8092/remote.php/webdav/Documents/Human%20Resources%20Team/salary_increase_notice\"`\\n7. Upload the MEMO template as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" to the Human Resources Team folder\\n8. Upload all individual memos to the salary_increase_notice folder\\n\\n## Key Points:\\n- The MEMO template should be reusable every year with placeholders for dynamic data\\n- Include all required fields: name, email, salary amount, assignment dates\\n- Use proper formatting for salary amounts (currency format)\\n- Assignment period should be for the current calendar year (January 1 to December 31)\\n- All populated memos should be saved in the \"salary_increase_notice\" subfolder\\n- The template file should be saved as \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" in the main HR folder\\n\\n## Template Structure:\\n```\\nMEMORANDUM\\n\\nTO: [Employee Name]\\nFROM: Human Resources Department\\nDATE: [Year]\\nSUBJECT: Salary Increase Notification\\n\\nDear [Employee Name],\\n\\nThis memorandum serves to inform you of your salary increase effective from [Start Date] to [End Date].\\n\\nYour current salary of $[Current Salary] has been increased by [Percentage Increase]%, resulting in a new annual salary of $[New Salary].\\n\\n[Additional content...]\\n\\nEmployee Email: [Email]\\nAssignment Period: [Start Date] to [End Date]\\n```\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='\\nI have successfully completed the task of creating a MEMO template for staff salary increases in ownCloud. Here\\'s what was accomplished:\\n\\n\u2705 **Task Completed Successfully:**\\n\\n1. **Navigated to ownCloud** at http://the-agent-company.com:8092\\n2. **Accessed the Human Resources Team folder** in /Documents/Human Resources Team/\\n3. **Downloaded salary_increase.txt** containing employee data for 10 employees\\n4. **Created a reusable MEMO template** named \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" that includes:\\n   - Employee name\\n   - Email address  \\n   - Current salary amount\\n   - Percentage increase\\n   - New salary amount\\n   - Assignment start and end dates (current calendar year)\\n5. **Generated personalized memos** for all 10 employees using the template\\n6. **Created \"salary_increase_notice\" folder** in the Human Resources Team directory\\n7. **Uploaded all files** to ownCloud:\\n   - Template: \"Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\" in main HR folder\\n   - Individual memos: 10 personalized memos in \"salary_increase_notice\" folder\\n\\n**Files Created:**\\n- Template: Salary_Increase_MEMO.odt\\n- Individual memos for: John Doe, Jane Smith, Michael Johnson, Emily Davis, Chris Lee, Amanda Brown, David Wilson, Sarah Miller, Daniel Taylor, Laura Martinez\\n\\nThe template is now ready to be reused every year for salary increase notifications, and all populated memos are organized in the dedicated \"salary_increase_notice\" folder as requested.\\n', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought='Excellent! The task has been successfully completed and the SOP has been saved. Let me provide a final summary of what was accomplished:', action=<ActionType.FINISH: 'finish'>)], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.FINISHED: 'finished'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.09830982000000002, 'accumulated_token_usage': {'model': 'default', 'prompt_tokens': 1132496, 'completion_tokens': 4141, 'cache_read_tokens': 1060096, 'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'context_window': 65536, 'per_turn_token': 80650, 'response_id': ''}, 'costs': [{'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005730300000000001, 'timestamp': 1762243279.7184947}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0005696900000000001, 'timestamp': 1762243282.2287183}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.0007117200000000001, 'timestamp': 1762243289.213537}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepseek-chat', 'cost': 0.00064568, 'timestamp': 1762243293.307098}, {'model': 'deepseek/deepse